      "label": "man_stealing_bicycle",
      "description": "A man in a dark hoodie is using bolt cutters to cut the frame of a bicycle, indicating an act of theft. The scene is framed to emphasize his urgency and the imminent threat of being caught, as suggested by the overlaid text. The man is positioned in the foreground, leaning over the bicycle, with the bicycle and tools being the central objects of interaction.",
