      "label": "Property Crime Normalization",
      "description": "The meme's humor relies on the normalization and trivialization of theft by framing it as a comedic, high-stakes situation. This can desensitize viewers to the seriousness of property crime and potentially encourage or normalize theft by making it seem like a funny, manageable situation. The underlying message about theft and the consequences of being caught can be seen as harmful by promoting a cavalier attitude toward property crime.",
