      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Thief is mapped as 'Patrick'",
      "description": "The text 'pedal faster patrick,' explicitly names the thief in the image as 'Patrick,' creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the man stealing the bicycle) is identified as the textual entity 'Patrick.' This is a generic placeholder used to represent any thief, allowing the meme to be broadly applicable while maintaining a humorous, non-specific tone.",
